      "currency": "GBP",
      "description": "Pocket Guide to Megaliths is a unique guide to Ancient and Prehistoric sites worldwide, accessing data submitted by contributors to the Megalithic Portal web resource for over almost 20 years. It has a built in database to allow navigation to sites and provides extra features such as live weather, sunset and moon phase information for all locations.\n\nProceeds from the app will support continuing development of the app and the Megalithic Portal Society's website, helping to increase the knowledge and protection of these precious sites.\n\nDeveloped in collaboration with \n\nThe Megalithic Portal\nAndy Burnham - Editor in Chief and Founder\nhttp://www.megalithic.co.uk\n\nThe app accesses an ever growing database of around 50,000 sites and entries worldwide. Each entry is categorised and allows filtering using a range of criteria such as over 70 different site types, map accuracy, condition, access, country of origin, location etc.\n\nIncludes a wide range of information from the Stone Age, Paleolithic, Mesolithic, Neolithic, Chalcolithic, Bronze Age through to the Iron Age and the numerous tribal societies such as Celtic.\n\nNews View\n\n• Provides a short list of the latest entries and news items,  updated regularly.\n• News items may be selected to discover further detailed comments provided by the Megalithic Portal.\n\nMain View\n\n• Global filter, allows views to be restricted to specific selections based on criteria.\n• Categorise by type, country, condition, accuracy, access, ambience.\n\nEntry Details\n\n• Detail page for every entry with useful information.\n• Link to Map location.\n• Link to the Megalithic Portal to read up on more information, pictures comments.\n• Full colour photo for many entries.\n• Select photo to use pinch to zoom.\n\nSearches\n\n• Map view, discover the Megaliths around the world or just those near you.\n• Find megaliths by text searching or filtering.\n- nb. Wildcards are supported\n\nCustom Features\n\n• Easily bookmark search results or individual entries to the bookmark view\n• Add your own Custom Notes to ANY entry with the handy edit feature\n\nUseful utilities are included to help when you are out exploring such as\n\n• Flashlight\n• Compass\n• A Range and Height Finder.\n• Worldwide day and night weather prediction view for around the next 5 days.\n• Moon phases for the next 70 days.\n• Sunrise/Sunset, Moon Rise/Set and Twilight Start/Set.\n\nSocial Networking\n\n• Twitter and Facebook post notes to your wall or feed\nLogin to the Accounts in Settings\n\nInstalling the data\n\n• CHECK DATABASE function to install or update data as necessary, may be performed as often as you like.\n\nContacting Us\n\nPlease contact us to discuss the app, ask support questions or make suggestions for improvements.\n\n• support@senet.co.uk\n• http://www.senet.co.uk\n• @SenetUK\n\nPlease direct any updates to the content directly to the Megalithic Portal\n\n• http://www.megalithic.co.uk\n\nNotes:\n\n• This App requires an internet connection for some of its features.\n• Slow internet connection speed will affect the performance for some features.\n• We cannot answer questions on the appstore, please contact us directly with any support questions or issues.\n\n• On older devices such as iPad mini,  the database may take some time to update,  close running apps first and please also ensure you have updated the device with all the latest patches from Apple.\n\n• Occasionally a few pictures show as rotated, this is an error which we are aware of and are looking into it.",
